@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - UML State Machine Diagram

state StartChoice <<choice>>
state LoggedOut
state AccountCreation
state Login
state Application
state Payment
state Accepted
state StatusView
state StatusCheck
state Cancellation
state DetailsModification
state DetailsView
state Feedback
state Logout

[*]StartChoice --> AccountCreation: Create Account
AccountCreation --> Login: LoggedIn
Login --> Application: Apply For Visa
Application --> Payment: Make Payment
Payment --> Accepted: Application Accepted
Accepted --> StatusView: View Status
StatusView --> StatusCheck: Check Status
StatusCheck --> Feedback: Give Feedback
Feedback --> Logout: LoggedOut
LoggedOut --> DetailsModification: Modify Details
DetailsModification --> DetailsView: View Details
DetailsView --> Logout: LoggedOut
Login --> Cancellation: Cancel Application
Cancellation --> Logout: LoggedOut
@enduml
